  "description": {
   "en": "Silenzio Agata, a hero of unparalleled fame known as the \"Sword of Alba.\" His second life suddenly begins as a carefree school life?! After whimsically saving the life of a feathered fairy along the way, he ends up studying abroad at a \"school for elven boys and girls\" --?!",
